        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These goggles are usually fitted with a polished piece of yellowtoned crystal, allowing the wearer some protection against the brightness of the sun. Near the Crown of the World, a version of these goggles exists where the crystal is replaced by thin slits, mitigating the effects of the sun's reflection on snow."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When wearing these goggles, you gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against effects that could inflict the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "943dfd55-ad09-5abf-9138-95a6149d3302"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["saving-throw"],
        "type": "item",
        "value": 1,
        "predicate": ["inflicts:dazzled"],
